cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the exact immutable WebChess release identity and its mapped paper for The Arachne Method; this candidate has no DOI."
title: "WebChess: reference software instrument for The Arachne Method"
type: software
abstract: >-
  WebChess is the reference software instrument for the experimental program
  called The Arachne Method. Version 2.2.0-rc.1 is a release candidate whose exact source commit,
  paper edition 3.1, and artifact digests must be read from the generated
  webchess-release-identity/1 manifest. Software conformance does not establish
  efficacy, and no DOI is claimed for this candidate.
authors:
  - family-names: "Reynolds"
    given-names: "Jack"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jr4488/webchess"
url: "https://github.com/jr4488/webchess"
version: 2.2.0-rc.1
